            "review_title": "Review at Cua Thu Thiet-Dac San Ca Mau",
            "review_text": "Nathantran\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam383 contributions\n0\nGood food excellent service\nMay 2018 • Family\nThe quality and variety of foods here was very good! Their specialty is in crab so you can't go wrong with it! However the service here was outstanding with waitresses went out of their ways to make sure you had a very happy and satisfied culinary experience here!\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 2, 2018",
